{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fc/ald10ix0huqytwbegjuun0uu281x5gt.mp3","text":"给其他部门的资料都整理完了，植物也刚浇过水......啊，这是您想要的水，点心也已经麻烦食堂在做了。请您放心，我事先都找其他干员了解过了，不会出差错的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4146_nymph/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b8/fvey9v3meb7lld8n5hp6rsqic2mr8wi.mp3","text":"我家旁边就有个输送能源的小熔炉，埃米说过它的用处，不过我们一般用它来烤食物、烘衣服，还有取暖。听别人说，只要在使用炉子前敲两下，先祖的护佑就会一直在身边。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4146_nymph/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/40/44uwc9da2r7i67hbljrzhplrrfup10r.mp3","text":"笞心魔不读心，也不会吸走情感，更不会吃脑子！真是的，您从哪里听来的胡言乱语呀！您要是再说这些，我可要生气了！信不信我现在就扑上来，把您的脑袋咔咔啃下来！","alt":"voice_cn/char_4146_nymph/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/cf/dckpqsrfieo57gutvjcd0ug0bqvc007.mp3","text":"当时在城里找先祖的时候，埃米把这个方块送给我暂时用来装他们。现在嘛，我就用它来装些大件行李。我很想知道它是怎么运作的，但巫妖的技术太复杂了，就算埃米袒露心灵，还是很难搞懂。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4146_nymph/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7b/4lz15areakp0zktkcmy0gpovsvebz9v.mp3","text":"这笔钱得好好计划计划，嘻嘻......嗯，您好啊博士。这个？这是合法收入，帮朋友们排忧解难收些报酬也很正常嘛。您问我做了什么？唔，也就帮人找找宠物、整理思绪之类，没什么特别的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4146_nymph/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a7/fx388vhcvooe7t44uv6ix272j2t95k8.mp3","text":"我最近做得怎么样，您还满意吗？信赖和青睐还是有区别的，毕竟笞心魔很容易获得后者，但前者嘛......唔，我听得出来，谢谢您的信任，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4146_nymph/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:7/73/i2cfdg4ohzpnt36tnc352l1cd071gmi.mp3","text":"爸爸妈妈离开好一阵了。想他们吗？嗯......还行吧。我是他们的孩子，又不是他们的一部分。我能够自力更生了，没道理把他们强留在身边。只要能感受到他们的爱，就随他们去吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4146_nymph/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b0/8dese2w4jx1c4aqyzh56argzfbjenl4.mp3","text":"笞心魔笞心魔，鞭笞别人心灵的同时，也得记得鞭笞自己的。传说曾经有过度放纵心灵而疯癫的同族，最终被魔王亲手击杀了。当、当然，我从没亲眼见过。总之，只要守好本心，就不会有事的！","alt":"voice_cn/char_4146_nymph/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/dd/9aq39vd8lhqrr0m2ksr22ce1p1593r4.mp3","text":"鞭笞心灵可不是闹着玩的，您真要试试看吗？好，好吧。我会控制好度的。看着我的眼睛......啊，对不起，我有点紧张，心都提到嗓子眼了。下、下次再试吧，我得准备一下......","alt":"voice_cn/char_4146_nymph/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e5/brr6pkjwjv9b3hrikaspxfxjwdy0n74.mp3","text":"真是个好梦，我也有点困了......","alt":"voice_cn/char_4146_nymph/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:6/68/c4yufq6pwfw7k27bicd2jvxfg4zoeo9.mp3","text":"对不起，我来迟了！刚刚和人事部的姐姐多聊了几句，没注意时间......您就是博士吧，我叫妮芙，有什么麻烦事都可以来找我，我很擅长解决麻烦的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4146_nymph/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:7/79/8ejpyvpeq74o17ch9r2p3vj8jpxdia5.mp3","text":"挺有意思的，我能不能拿些回去放？","alt":"voice_cn/char_4146_nymph/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b9/nlrhtbpb78fdyvbvt06fafypxkz2c3w.mp3","text":"以前我只在军事委员会的人身上见过这样的徽章，谢谢您~","alt":"voice_cn/char_4146_nymph/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:0/02/k0e95cdn3e7cf97qhfghilhknc0mdbd.mp3","text":"让我和您交个心吧，博士。我们一定能够更加了解对方的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4146_nymph/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a3/r1naevt6n06ucvwx5kli10udwp00wvf.mp3","text":"真得用武力解决问题吗......？","alt":"voice_cn/char_4146_nymph/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:1/10/eqnhqww2rv1dlw6wo2ihanv4nlsfsxy.mp3","text":"我知道了......别担心，我来想办法。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4146_nymph/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c9/lu1thib2thbc54zonwr9qbii4x2c744.mp3","text":"该出发了，不能总是犹犹豫豫的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4146_nymph/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4f/6ij5wucckji60feyrkp3gj0l4zyunl1.mp3","text":"专心些，妮芙，这、这没什么难的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4146_nymph/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ef/98tjgde5krfv73ngnsyogw4xomp5l4c.mp3","text":"我、我吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_4146_nymph/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/43/1lz5fxduup3m7cboevisl6fwccgwu15.mp3","text":"唉......","alt":"voice_cn/char_4146_nymph/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:c/ca/9tqa49316bfu2xbe3l5y9wltgy9pnfr.mp3","text":"还是有些紧张......","alt":"voice_cn/char_4146_nymph/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/13/0n8ii1dih7gtdddm08s4mnnldebsvq7.mp3","text":"加油！","alt":"voice_cn/char_4146_nymph/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7f/b6wtwe62r2fvrl8go807wco1rae9pc9.mp3","text":"看着我的眼睛！","alt":"voice_cn/char_4146_nymph/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/1b/fbkmwix6n7svq39jp2odwuqo2sm7p75.mp3","text":"回头吧，别让心碎在这里。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4146_nymph/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a7/fkyasggfmp136ttks8487nbcmta784d.mp3","text":"将这钥索，挥向心灵！","alt":"voice_cn/char_4146_nymph/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/55/ef25vau64qyheqtmrhni3tc8wjlps9e.mp3","text":"锁已经解开了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4146_nymph/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:f/ff/i5kr2nl3ss4bft4hk7rf18lb0evjb4d.mp3","text":"那些布局已经是条件反射了吗？好厉害！","alt":"voice_cn/char_4146_nymph/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2f/2w5rgkxucfr1bd0l4w1kjvodl24e7qa.mp3","text":"从您的指挥里我学到了很多，说不定以后我也能用得上哦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4146_nymph/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:3/30/lhhr5hbrpmbyg03943lne3rmwpmr1fs.mp3","text":"别想啦，让他们走吧，我们该回去了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4146_nymph/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7a/75iul6o7npmw55x9lrb16cs507p19jz.mp3","text":"别怕！我、我来想想，总会有办法的......","alt":"voice_cn/char_4146_nymph/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:7/79/r8tzz3750i1srnda7i2p4fp79de44dd.mp3","text":"好干净啊，简单布置一下肯定能变成很舒适的小窝。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4146_nymph/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:7/73/lpt2uwntcogb98j95oi41zt2rzuh8qn.mp3","text":"别胡闹啦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4146_nymph/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8e/85h97elmh2sak3fez1lrhfg251oe9iv.mp3","text":"您心底里的那把锁没有钥匙？别担心，我会帮您找到它的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4146_nymph/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:6/68/c634n5t0or8oq2m8nwd7inp4hxivwov.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4146_nymph/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5f/7iysf6axa6kve0dlp41e3ex3z8isac3.mp3","text":"到处都是欢声笑语，沉浸在这样的氛围里心都要化了......今天就好好狂欢一下吧，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4146_nymph/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:6/67/fueij8tgjvb1i2abdv4gt4qn74rkrqh.mp3","text":"让自己的思绪休息下吧，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4146_nymph/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:4/43/l62lfnwiuojddv49b27z61wj2kdwigt.mp3","text":"给其他部门的资料都整理完了，植物也刚浇过水......啊，这是您想要的水，点心也已经麻烦食堂在做了。请您放心，我事先都找其他干员了解过了，不会出差错的。","alt":"voice/char_4146_nymph/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ed/9chffowk57swcaup13lsjm5wfm8y4yg.mp3","text":"我家旁边就有个输送能源的小熔炉，埃米说过它的用处，不过我们一般用它来烤食物、烘衣服，还有取暖。听别人说，只要在使用炉子前敲两下，先祖的护佑就会一直在身边。","alt":"voice/char_4146_nymph/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/6a/gjyjqauhs0bdz3u40f9nph8twvpaho4.mp3","text":"笞心魔不读心，也不会吸走情感，更不会吃脑子！真是的，您从哪里听来的胡言乱语呀！您要是再说这些，我可要生气了！信不信我现在就扑上来，把您的脑袋咔咔啃下来！","alt":"voice/char_4146_nymph/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/17/iqlf2phwpst5ojo0atpl0coyfvhaewx.mp3","text":"当时在城里找先祖的时候，埃米把这个方块送给我暂时用来装他们。现在嘛，我就用它来装些大件行李。我很想知道它是怎么运作的，但巫妖的技术太复杂了，就算埃米袒露心灵，还是很难搞懂。","alt":"voice/char_4146_nymph/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f9/bjlfp6y3xzkh25lscdphdwgfpu5xshf.mp3","text":"这笔钱得好好计划计划，嘻嘻......嗯，您好啊博士。这个？这是合法收入，帮朋友们排忧解难收些报酬也很正常嘛。您问我做了什么？唔，也就帮人找找宠物、整理思绪之类，没什么特别的。","alt":"voice/char_4146_nymph/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/03/6z29o8ny8cnkf423cd0i2kj3ngyvev2.mp3","text":"我最近做得怎么样，您还满意吗？信赖和青睐还是有区别的，毕竟笞心魔很容易获得后者，但前者嘛......唔，我听得出来，谢谢您的信任，博士。","alt":"voice/char_4146_nymph/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4a/kfhke7mb9np3jyorbrai8lqvr0wvzxz.mp3","text":"爸爸妈妈离开好一阵了。想他们吗？嗯......还行吧。我是他们的孩子，又不是他们的一部分。我能够自力更生了，没道理把他们强留在身边。只要能感受到他们的爱，就随他们去吧。","alt":"voice/char_4146_nymph/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/96/gcggrqu0iwdk7kaimj22kzn5bkrq70l.mp3","text":"笞心魔笞心魔，鞭笞别人心灵的同时，也得记得鞭笞自己的。传说曾经有过度放纵心灵而疯癫的同族，最终被魔王亲手击杀了。当、当然，我从没亲眼见过。总之，只要守好本心，就不会有事的！","alt":"voice/char_4146_nymph/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a5/nt7ztgf9bjxadlzqkk1ksh4u4lece0w.mp3","text":"鞭笞心灵可不是闹着玩的，您真要试试看吗？好，好吧。我会控制好度的。看着我的眼睛......啊，对不起，我有点紧张，心都提到嗓子眼了。下、下次再试吧，我得准备一下......","alt":"voice/char_4146_nymph/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1c/obq2mmfvy4gnjrh91g8ntp591rd89z5.mp3","text":"真是个好梦，我也有点困了......","alt":"voice/char_4146_nymph/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:6/66/f2q54aas4j2osaut4lioscseobxu1go.mp3","text":"对不起，我来迟了！刚刚和人事部的姐姐多聊了几句，没注意时间......您就是博士吧，我叫妮芙，有什么麻烦事都可以来找我，我很擅长解决麻烦的。","alt":"voice/char_4146_nymph/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fe/h8b89vsfggr8t266pq84j73twrw9nxu.mp3","text":"挺有意思的，我能不能拿些回去放？","alt":"voice/char_4146_nymph/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:7/78/emw5a6bk8tvagk4dcqked1f1lxinm0z.mp3","text":"以前我只在军事委员会的人身上见过这样的徽章，谢谢您~","alt":"voice/char_4146_nymph/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7f/2hxeevh46p7hfidn9lt7wejscw0uhtn.mp3","text":"让我和您交个心吧，博士。我们一定能够更加了解对方的。","alt":"voice/char_4146_nymph/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:1/10/sf4v5lhck0m425y01btcysvm4zqfher.mp3","text":"真得用武力解决问题吗......？","alt":"voice/char_4146_nymph/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:3/34/lvr3cd1j833sgog7pf9xccskga5olnx.mp3","text":"我知道了......别担心，我来想办法。","alt":"voice/char_4146_nymph/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:d/dc/jvgwx52rnjybw44ckdjm80o81pfw26h.mp3","text":"该出发了，不能总是犹犹豫豫的。","alt":"voice/char_4146_nymph/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4b/kfjyhotir0q2gwgq3z4ld93nuimh41a.mp3","text":"专心些，妮芙，这、这没什么难的。","alt":"voice/char_4146_nymph/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:5/51/andvubii8kx0l5cjkvy58dxct54z7p9.mp3","text":"我、我吗？","alt":"voice/char_4146_nymph/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/61/lpopgxn0jswvbtbdlvsp0trrniop96d.mp3","text":"唉......","alt":"voice/char_4146_nymph/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:9/92/evwrv7j3say7lte14mr8wpiiykoirll.mp3","text":"还是有些紧张......","alt":"voice/char_4146_nymph/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d4/3s8px8n9o5dow5b1big3bjntvgfqpbz.mp3","text":"加油！","alt":"voice/char_4146_nymph/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7b/ohy4fh0wdr46jio4mvx95jtuqjz4fpx.mp3","text":"看着我的眼睛！","alt":"voice/char_4146_nymph/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c7/cfbcvujvfhvf2mkjj2f5ltl9z7dw2wa.mp3","text":"回头吧，别让心碎在这里。","alt":"voice/char_4146_nymph/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/1d/flv54uj6drdjzj8qg2y3w4twe49vjui.mp3","text":"将这钥索，挥向心灵！","alt":"voice/char_4146_nymph/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d0/rs8223w1douybhn9iy4fkmtndjzaj7y.mp3","text":"锁已经解开了。","alt":"voice/char_4146_nymph/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1f/6lohn2asuhfpzb8s82gno1qr4s8hq17.mp3","text":"那些布局已经是条件反射了吗？好厉害！","alt":"voice/char_4146_nymph/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c9/enufp3x6q3inni512kz2z6x8q73lbjl.mp3","text":"从您的指挥里我学到了很多，说不定以后我也能用得上哦。","alt":"voice/char_4146_nymph/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:9/90/ot9ec9f2zkmc2j8hp7fwfryuu4g3ckg.mp3","text":"别想啦，让他们走吧，我们该回去了。","alt":"voice/char_4146_nymph/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3a/d474aqnc2rtokar8in215nauj4c7d71.mp3","text":"别怕！我、我来想想，总会有办法的......","alt":"voice/char_4146_nymph/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:6/60/f8flkfplczyswykxkj63spuwpic7msj.mp3","text":"好干净啊，简单布置一下肯定能变成很舒适的小窝。","alt":"voice/char_4146_nymph/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b9/5fh5062kibz7e9ifj8g9niuqg8s8yx4.mp3","text":"别胡闹啦。","alt":"voice/char_4146_nymph/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:9/92/45ef41rsou8epc2tqgca73svtrhl7tw.mp3","text":"您心底里的那把锁没有钥匙？别担心，我会帮您找到它的。","alt":"voice/char_4146_nymph/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:2/24/9m2kpgs4q426lvmc5aa9ppqi4fbfxya.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice/char_4146_nymph/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:0/09/fracyakn4ul1ltsc3h5xw74o778f33o.mp3","text":"到处都是欢声笑语，沉浸在这样的氛围里心都要化了......今天就好好狂欢一下吧，博士。","alt":"voice/char_4146_nymph/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2b/jghx84wl1oz5g492toqr9kkuw5hosvo.mp3","text":"让自己的思绪休息下吧，博士。","alt":"voice/char_4146_nymph/cn_042.mp3"}]}}